/E (The community ranks twelfth in terms of membership of the principal trade unions \(1.6% of non-EU members\), prevalently holding membership with CGIL \(Italian General Confederation of Labour\) \(53.4%\). Out of an estimated 79,000 Bangladeshi workers, 12,540 are union members, accounting for just over one-sixth of the total. )
