<<
/Title (Subject of the survey and reference period The Annual Reports on Migrant Communities \(ed. 2025\) analyse the specific characteristics of the 16 largest non-EU communities in the country, considering socio-demographic characteristics, types and modes of residence, presence in the school and university system, as well as integration in the labour market and access to welfare. The editorial line consists of 16 reports dedicated to individual nationalities. The period analysed is the year 2024, although for some areas the latest available data date back to the previous year, 2023, while for Unaccompanied Foreign Minors \(UAMs\), the data are updated to June 30, 2025. The reference period is always specified both in the text and in the titles of the table or figure presenting the data.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 32 0 R
/Next 1217 0 R
>>
