/Title (As regards the distribution of Bangladeshi workers across economic sectors, the community is greatly funnelled in the hospitality and industrial sectors. More specifically, 32% of Bangladeshis employed in Italy work in Hotels and restaurants, while 25.3% work in Industry proper. The community's presence in the commercial sector is also significant, with approximately 23% of workers employed in this sector.)
